    "body": "Antigravity (len) stopped before the claim. Issue #2223 depends on #2217 and #2218.\n\nCurrent `upstream/main` (`0957b20aa5d6dee30b08a13a5613e3960c22ec92`) has no `crates/gcode` (`camcraft-gcode`) and no runner for external NC simulation.\n\n- Issue #2217 is open. Its latest comment records held work on `mkinney:issue/2217-camcraft-gcode` at `711314efd`, with `claimed` removed.\n- Issue #2218 is open. Its latest comment reports that it stopped before the claim because #2217 is not on `upstream/main`.\n- Neither #2217 nor #2218 has an open PR on `NeoTech/Camcraft` to stack on.\n\nThis run works #2223 only and cannot implement #2217 or #2218. The cutter radius compensation work and `Dexel` stock checks cannot build or run until those dependencies land.\n\nThis run made no claim, worktree, code change, or test run. Suggestion: set `blocked` until #2217 and #2218 merge. The maintainer decides.\n",
